        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A relationship between a biomarker &apos;b&apos; and its assessed entity &apos;e&apos;, whereby &apos;e&apos; is found to be present in cases where it is typically absent (in an individual or population of interest).</obo:IAO_0000115>
