        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A relationship between a biomarker &apos;b&apos; and its assessed entity &apos;e&apos;, whereby &apos;e&apos; is found to be absent in cases where it is typically present (in an individual or population of interest).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5809-9523</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
