        <obo:IAO_0000116>This class is specifically for cases where the assessed entity pertains to DNA as a biochemical; that is, without regard to sequence. Sequence-based biomarkers are classed under sequence variation biomarker (OBCI:000000022).</obo:IAO_0000116>
