        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A defined characteristic or set of characteristics derived from two or more data sources evaluated through an algorithm as an indicator of normal biological processes, pathogenic processes or responses to an exposure or intervention, including therapeutic interventions and environmental exposures.</owl:annotatedTarget>
